sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as Deterministic caller (CMP-003)
    participant Gateway as Tool Gateway (CMP-005)
    participant Registry as Tool Registry (INT-016)
    participant Validator as Schema Validator
    participant Policy as Local Policy Engine (INT-018)
    participant Controls as Runtime Controls
    participant Adapter as Tool Adapter (INT-019)
    participant Evidence as Event Writer (INT-020)

    Caller->>Gateway: DATA-036 ToolInvocationRequest
    Gateway->>Registry: resolve TOOL-ID + exact version
    Registry-->>Gateway: DATA-035 descriptor + hash
    Gateway->>Validator: validate arguments against Draft 2020-12 schema
    Validator-->>Gateway: valid / fail closed
    Gateway->>Policy: subject, action, tool, purpose, residency, approval
    Policy-->>Gateway: DATA-037 allow/deny + obligations
    Gateway->>Controls: idempotency, rate limit, circuit, timeout, retry class
    alt dry-run reversible write
        Controls-->>Gateway: no side effect
    else permitted execution
        Gateway->>Adapter: typed arguments + bounded principal context
        Adapter-->>Gateway: typed result or error
        Gateway->>Validator: validate result + enforce byte limit
    end
    Gateway->>Evidence: hashed/redacted DATA-040 event
    Gateway-->>Caller: DATA-038 ToolResultEnvelope
